---
import { person, certs, certCategories, journey, stackWeb, stackCloud } from '../data/site';

const certGroups = Object.entries(certCategories).map(([key, label]) => ({
  label,
  items: certs.filter((c) => c.cat === key),
}));
const stackList = [...stackWeb, ...stackCloud].map((t) => t.name).join(', ');
---

<section id="faq" class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <h2 id="faq-title" class="title">Frequently asked questions</h2>

  <div class="faq">
    <details class="item reveal" open>
      <summary><span class="num">01</span><span class="q">What kind of work are you looking for?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        <p>I’m looking for graduate programmes and junior roles in software engineering, especially where I can grow into cloud and DevOps work. I’m currently a Software Developer Intern at Safety IO.</p>
        <p>I also take on freelance and side projects: APIs, backend services, full-stack web apps, or help containerising and deploying something you’ve already built.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="item reveal">
      <summary><span class="num">02</span><span class="q">What’s your tech stack?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        <p>Day to day I work with {stackList}.</p>
        <p>I’m most at home building REST APIs in Python (FastAPI, Django) or Node.js (Express), backed by PostgreSQL or MongoDB, then packaging them with Docker and automating delivery with GitHub Actions.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="item reveal">
      <summary><span class="num">03</span><span class="q">What certifications do you hold?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        <p>{certs.length} so far, and still collecting. The headline ones are the <strong>AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner</strong> and the <strong>Google Cybersecurity Specialization</strong>.</p>
        <div class="certs">
          {
            certGroups.map((g) => (
              <div>
                <h3 class="group">{g.label} <span class="muted">{g.items.length}</span></h3>
                <ul>
                  {g.items.map((c) => (
                    <li>
                      {c.title} <span class="muted">· {c.issuer}</span>
                    </li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="item reveal">
      <summary><span class="num">04</span><span class="q">What’s your background?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        <p>I studied IT at Tshwane University of Technology, then trained as a software engineer at WeThinkCode_, where I now mentor first-year students. Here’s the story so far:</p>
        <ol class="timeline">
          {
            journey.map((j) => (
              <li>
                <span class="when muted">{j.when}</span>
                <span>
                  <strong>{j.title}</strong> <span class="muted">· {j.where}</span>
                  <br />
                  <span class="muted">{j.text}</span>
                </span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ol>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="item reveal">
      <summary><span class="num">05</span><span class="q">Can I see more of your work?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        <p>The projects above are a selection. Everything else, including experiments and work in progress, is on <a class="inline-link" href={person.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">my GitHub</a>.</p>
        <p>For a fuller picture of my experience, download my <a class="inline-link" href={person.cv.href} download>professional CV</a> ({person.cv.size}).</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="item reveal">
      <summary><span class="num">06</span><span class="q">How can we work together?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
      <div class="a">
        <p>Email me at <a class="inline-link" href={`mailto:${person.email}`}>{person.email}</a>. For roles, include the team and what you’re building. For projects, include the scope, timeline and budget. The more detail the better.</p>
        <p>You can also reach me on <a class="inline-link" href={person.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }
  .faq {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .num {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .q {
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  summary:hover .q {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .icon {
    position: relative;
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
  }
  .icon::before,
  .icon::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 50% 0 auto;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: currentColor;
    transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease);
  }
  .icon::after {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
  .item[open] .icon::after {
    transform: rotate(0deg);
  }
  .a {
    padding: 0 0 2rem 5rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
    color: var(--mute);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .a > p + p,
  .a > p + div,
  .a > p + ol {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .a strong {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .item[open] .a {
    animation: open 0.5s var(--ease);
  }
  @keyframes open {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-6px);
    }
  }

  .certs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem 2rem;
  }
  .group {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .certs li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text);
    padding-block: 0.3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .timeline li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 10rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .when {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    summary {
      grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr auto;
    }
    .a {
      padding-left: 0;
    }
    .timeline li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
